UID: EV-SDOC-BOARD-MERGED-SMOKE
TITLE: The merged app serves both views from the live daemon
DEPTH: implemented
AUTHORED_BY: llm
SOURCE: Live scribe daemon (generation 3) and headless ungoogled-chromium 151 driven over the DevTools pipe; system python3; 2026-09-01
STATEMENT: >>>
Nine hermetic contracts passed under system python3: adapter fixtures covering
edge resolution, the dangling-target diagnostic, per-table union key sets and
degree facets, plus the HTTP allowlist, 405s on mutating methods, and a 503
whose body carries "devenv up scribe". Against the live daemon the server
adapted 384 nodes, 922 resolved edges, 0 diagnostics and 953 relation rows;
/api/graph served 1,306,012 bytes and /api/rows 1,470,894 bytes at generation
3, and a repeat request answered from the generation cache in about 18 ms with
no export. In the driven browser the Board drew the whole canon with all seven
type accents, and a hash-selected node dimmed unrelated topology and filled
the inspector; the Perspective view rendered the Aurora datagrid at 384 rows
by 8 columns, and the Relations switch rendered 953 rows by 8 with source and
target facets. Switching tables via restore({table}) was refused with "Unknown
column SOURCE_TYPE in field columns"; loading the Table object directly worked
and logs upstream's deprecation of that path.
<<<
